{"repositoryId":1422549986,"availability":"available","full":"serlisovyk/Todo","name":"Todo","description":"Accessible todo app with categories, priorities, search, and filters, built with React, React Compiler, Vite, JavaScript, and plain CSS.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-16T18:46:00Z","updated":"2026-10-19T15:48:56Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://todo-plum-nu-78.vercel.app","topics":["accessibility","css","dark-mode","frontend","indexeddb","javascript","localstorage","performance","react","react-compiler","responsive-design","todo-app","todo-list","vite"],"demo":"https://todo-plum-nu-78.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T15:56:11.010Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T15:56:11.010Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T15:56:11.010Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T15:56:11.010Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["✅ A fast, accessible todo list with categories, priorities, search, and filters, saved in your browser.","Todo is a one-page app built with React 19 and Vite in plain JavaScript. Tasks never leave the browser: they are kept in localStorage or IndexedDB behind a swappable repository, and there is no backend, account, or analytics. The code is layered: constants, pure utilities, a storage layer, contexts for the app state, hooks for each component's logic, and components styled with plain CSS and design tokens."],"features":["Add, edit, complete, and delete tasks, with Undo for a deletion","A category (Work, Personal, Study, Shopping, Health) and a priority (Low, Medium, High) on every task","Search with highlighted matches, focused with the / key","Filters by status and category, and sorting by newest, oldest, or priority, kept in the URL","A tasks-left counter, mark all as done or active, and Clear completed"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/serlisovyk/Todo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"261afc9cb15